      "content": "it's happening again. i just got a notification that someone tried to login to my private cloud storage from an unknown IP. and then my car's GPS system started acting up, showing me locations i haven't even visited. it's like they aren't just trying to stop me from working, they're actively trying to isolate me and box me in. if they can control my money, my travel, and my digital life, how do i even know who i can trust anymore? even the police seem like they'd be too tied up in corporate interests to actually listen to me.",
